  "body": "Our vendors have found their next place to call home and are highly motivated to sell, presenting an exciting opportunity for first-home buyers and young families to secure this charming property. With clear instructions to sell, now is the time to act!\r\n\r\nCute as a button and packed with charm, this beautifully presented home combines modern comfort, everyday practicality and inviting outdoor living, with so much of the hard work already done.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a surprisingly spacious, light-filled living area complemented by neutral interiors and large windows. The tastefully renovated kitchen features contemporary cabinetry, quality finishes, a gas cooktop and generous storage, while the sun-filled conservatory-style dining area is the perfect spot to enjoy your morning coffee.\r\n\r\nExcellent indoor-outdoor flow leads to your own private garden retreat, complete with established landscaping, generous lawn areas, decking and a sheltered entertaining space. Picture summer barbecues with friends, children playing in the backyard and relaxed evenings enjoying your own private oasis.\r\n\r\nComfortable bedrooms, a modernised bathroom, garaging and additional off-street parking complete this incredibly appealing package.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n* Beautifully presented home bursting with character and charm\r\n* Spacious, light-filled living area\r\n* Tastefully renovated kitchen with gas cooking and generous storage\r\n* Sun-filled conservatory-style dining area\r\n* Modernised bathroom\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Private backyard with established gardens\r\n* Generous lawn areas for children to enjoy\r\n* Decking and sheltered outdoor entertaining area\r\n* Garaging and additional off-street parking\r\n* Fantastic opportunity for first-home buyers and young families\r\n\r\nWith summer just around the corner, there's no better time to secure a home you can simply move into and enjoy.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have made their next move and are committed to selling. Their motivation is your opportunity - don't sit back and wait. Get through the door, register your interest and make your move!\r\n\r\nTo be sold by Auction (unless sold prior) on Tuesday, 15 December 2026. from 6pm at the Bucklands Beach Yacht Club\r\n\r\nContact Renee or Kevin with a time to view!",
